    "title":  "Imitation Amnesty",
    "description":  "Delvin Mallory sends the player to Whiterun to help Olfrid Battle-Born free his friend Arn from execution by stealing an incriminating letter from the Jarl\u0027s quarters and forging the prison registry in Dragonsreach.",
